## 常见 Bug 模式

### 1. 图片加载无限循环

```javascript
// ❌ 可能导致无限重试
const handleError = () => {
  setImageSrc(fallbackUrl);
};

// ✅ 限制重试次数
const attemptsRef = useRef(0);
const MAX_RETRIES = 3;

const handleError = () => {
  if (attemptsRef.current >= MAX_RETRIES) {
    setImageSrc(gradientPlaceholder);
    return;
  }
  attemptsRef.current++;
  setImageSrc(getNextFallback());
};
```

### 2. 搜索卡顿

```javascript
// ❌ 每次搜索都重建 Fuse 实例
const search = (query) => {
  const fuse = new Fuse(allData, options); // 🔴 开销大
  return fuse.search(query);
};

// ✅ 缓存 Fuse 实例，数据变化时才重建
const fuseRef = useRef(null);
const dataHashRef = useRef(null);

const search = (query) => {
  const currentHash = hashData(allData);
  if (currentHash !== dataHashRef.current) {
    fuseRef.current = new Fuse(allData, options);
    dataHashRef.current = currentHash;
  }
  return fuseRef.current.search(query);
};
```

### 3. Session 数据不同步

```javascript
// ❌ 多处更新 session，容易不一致
// 在 background.js
sessions.push(newSession);
await chrome.storage.local.set({ sessions });

// 在 PersonalSpace.jsx
setSessions(prev => [...prev, newSession]);

// ✅ 单一数据源：storage 驱动 UI
// background.js 只写 storage
await chrome.storage.local.set({ sessions: [...sessions, newSession] });

// PersonalSpace.jsx 只监听 storage
useEffect(() => {
  const handleChange = (changes) => {
    if (changes.sessions) {
      setSessions(changes.sessions.newValue);
    }
  };
  chrome.storage.onChanged.addListener(handleChange);
  return () => chrome.storage.onChanged.removeListener(handleChange);
}, []);
```

